    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bangalore!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver\u2019s seat of your auto rickshaw and explore the open-world city of Bangalore.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to look for?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Bangalore</strong> - Drive through the streets of Bangalore, visit iconic neighborhoods and experience a living, breathing city brought to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride and Relax</strong> -\u00a0Complete trips at your own pace while listening to the radio with an extensive library of songs or add your own favorites to create the perfect vibe for your rides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the City:</strong>\u00a0Want more than trips? Take on 7  rival auto drivers, each dominating a part of Bangalore. Defeat them one-by-one to prove your skill and claim the title of the number 1 auto driver in Bangalore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey, isn\u2019t it better to conquer Bangalore\u2019s traffic from the comfort of your chair than being stuck in it for real?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for adrenaline-filled races or peaceful exploration, the choice is yours.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bangalore!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver\u2019s seat of your auto rickshaw and explore the open-world city of Bangalore.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to look for?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Bangalore</strong> - Drive through the streets of Bangalore, visit iconic neighborhoods and experience a living, breathing city brought to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ride and Relax</strong> -\u00a0Complete trips at your own pace while listening to the radio with an extensive library of songs or add your own favorites to create the perfect vibe for your rides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the City:</strong>\u00a0Want more than trips? Take on 7  rival auto drivers, each dominating a part of Bangalore. Defeat them one-by-one to prove your skill and claim the title of the number 1 auto driver in Bangalore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And hey, isn\u2019t it better to conquer Bangalore\u2019s traffic from the comfort of your chair than being stuck in it for real?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for adrenaline-filled races or peaceful exploration, the choice is yours.\u00a0</p>",
